String = Text handling in Python!
Used in EVERY DevOps task — parsing logs, building commands, generating configs & processing output! 🚀
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
🤔 What is String?
Think of String as Text 📝

Any text inside quotes = String

'hello'          → String
"hello"          → String
"192.168.1.1"   → String
"production"     → String
"nginx"          → String

# Single quotes
name = 'myapp'

# Double quotes
name = "myapp"

# Both are same!
